COMPILATION OF: E48B4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48B4

   1 a 0000 E48B4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1 r2] STATIC BIT + ONE AUTOMATIC, same literal.
   4 a 0006      Discriminates "statics are outside the section total" (DR
   5 a 0006      would be 1 + 1 + 2 = 4) from "the static byte is the
   6 a 0006      section" (DR would be 1 + 1 + 2 = 4 too) -- so read the
   7 a 0006      ADDRESSES, not just the size: b at 0000, 'T' at 0001, n at
   8 a 0006      0002 is the [C114] layout. */
   9 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  10 c 0006   dcl n fixed bin(15);
  11 c 0006   n = 1;
  12 c 000C   put list('T', n);
  13 c 002E   stop;
  14 a 0031 end E48B4;

CODE SIZE = 0031
DATA AREA = 0004
FREE SYMS = 38B0
END  COMPILATION
